---
---
<section class="relative min-h-[60vh] flex items-center bg-cover bg-center" style="background-image: url('/wp-content/uploads/service-header2.jpg');">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40"></div>
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 relative z-10 text-white">
        <h1 class="text-6xl font-serif mb-6 tracking-widest">澄星人<br/> Chengstarian</h1>
        <p class="text-2xl leading-relaxed tracking-wider max-w-2xl font-light">
            有一星球人,<br/>
            浮游於西太平洋島嶼的南城裡,<br/>
            以水為養份,與水脈相生,<br/>
            藉其力而前行,是為「澄」
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="py-24 bg-white">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-6xl space-y-32">
        <h2 class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] font-bold border-l-4 border-[#ffc04c] pl-4 mb-12">特質 ／ 特徵</h2>

        <!-- Feature 1 -->
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-16">
            <div class="md:w-1/3">
                <div class="relative group">
                    <img src="/wp-content/uploads/pro-faceicon1-2.jpg" alt="畫作化妝術" class="w-full rounded-full border-8 border-[#fdf8e8] shadow-xl group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" />
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="md:w-2/3 space-y-6">
                <h3 class="text-4xl font-serif text-[#f48f00]">畫作化妝術</h3>
                <h4 class="text-xl font-serif text-[#2D2E33] opacity-80 italic">Image Make-Up Magic</h4>
                <p class="text-xl leading-relaxed text-[#545353] font-light">
                    被孵化出形的圖像與繪畫和作品常常想向這個世界訴說著什麼，它們也有著一張張不同的臉蛋，那所謂的化妝並非是種純粹矯飾或偽裝的形體，是願為它們致力點綴出其質之不凡、與顯化出屬於它們各個獨一無二的性格模樣。
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="w-full h-[1px] bg-gray-100"></div>

        <!-- Feature 2 -->
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row-reverse items-center gap-16">
            <div class="md:w-1/3">
                <div class="relative group">
                    <img src="/wp-content/uploads/pro-faceicon2.jpg" alt="編排吸引力法" class="w-full rounded-full border-8 border-[#fdf8e8] shadow-xl group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" />
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="md:w-2/3 space-y-6 text-right">
                <h3 class="text-4xl font-serif text-[#f48f00]">編排吸引力法</h3>
                <h4 class="text-xl font-serif text-[#2D2E33] opacity-80 italic">Layout Law of attraction</h4>
                <p class="text-xl leading-relaxed text-[#545353] font-light">
                    造型與元素在字裡行間穿梭或停留，在虛實之間連結出各異空間的維度，互相探索著彼此適切的感距，排列出它們的調性樣態，時而獨白的變體演繹，喚起源源不絕的心神凝視之力，穿透情緒與其共振出盪漾心弦的感知。
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="w-full h-[1px] bg-gray-100"></div>

        <!-- Feature 3 -->
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-16">
            <div class="md:w-1/3">
                <div class="relative group">
                    <img src="/wp-content/uploads/pro-faceicon3.jpg" alt="調配色劑劑法" class="w-full rounded-full border-8 border-[#fdf8e8] shadow-xl group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" />
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="md:w-2/3 space-y-6">
                <h3 class="text-4xl font-serif text-[#f48f00]">調配色劑劑法</h3>
                <h4 class="text-xl font-serif text-[#2D2E33] opacity-80 italic">Colour Matching Potions</h4>
                <p class="text-xl leading-relaxed text-[#545353] font-light">
                    色與彩相之間猶如彼此傾訴著他們的質性，相鄰近似或匯聚融合，調劑碰撞出一番番萬幻的韻味景緻，它們的調配，臨在空間彷彿被賦予了生命之溫，時深時淺的觸發覺受，醍醐的灌入了彩光能量。
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="py-32 bg-[#2D2E33] text-white text-center">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 space-y-6">
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-serif tracking-widest">J.Cheng</h2>
        <p class="text-xl italic opacity-80">“願用我的魔法，點綴這視界的溫度”</p>
        <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.4em] pt-8 border-t border-white/10 max-w-xs mx-auto">~ Healing Temperature Magic ~</p>
    </div>
</section>
